From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: owner <owner@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:53:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 04/11] Taviri: the extension looks like Taviri

- The brand kit's logo, app icon and mark replace Bitwarden's artwork (webpack
  swaps libs/assets' logo, icon and shield modules and the notification bar's
  shield for src/autofill/smartfill/brand/; the button in fields uses the mark).
- Every saturated blue in the stylesheets and UI scripts becomes the brand colour
  (OKLCH hue rotation, lightness kept, neutral greys untouched).
- "Bitwarden" becomes the brand name in all locales and page titles, except the
  copyright, Bitwarden's servers, products and plans, and texts linking to
  Bitwarden's own site.
- Toolbar and extension icons are made from the kit's icon.svg.

All of it follows smartfill-brand/brand.json; SMARTFILL_BRANDING=off builds the
upstream look.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
